  IconPath: icons/weapons/wands/wand-carved-pink.webp
  Description: You place some of your magical power in a bonded item. Each day when
    you prepare your spells, you can designate a single item you own as your bonded
    item. This is typically an item associated with spellcasting, such as a wand,
    ring, or staff, but you are free to designate a weapon or other item. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Drain Bonded Item] free action.
